+                                        /* EXT_texture_from_pixmap. GLX_DONT_CARE, not 0:
+                                         * a direct-rendering Mesa client (llvmpipe,
+                                         * Zink) pairs each server fbconfig with one of
+                                         * its own and requires these to be equal or
